Four agents: Aqua offers and V3 trades. Confirmed outcomes update readouts.

8
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:46,033
Aqua | A freshly confirmed local settlement
Actual token transfers and contract events. Test tokens on an Anvil fork.

9
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:52,033
Uniswap V3 | A freshly confirmed local settlement
Actual token transfers and contract events. Test tokens on an Anvil fork.

10
00:00:52,033 --> 00:00:57,066
